{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0142pPdesjPB8H3j6sh9w6AH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: GPQA 全面复现 phase-dependent compound severity，且 strategy specificity\n2\t  强于 MATH-500（17× vs 15-17×），形成 reasoning-complexity 梯度（GSM8K 2.3-3.8× < MATH-500\n3\t  15-17× < GPQA 17×）。三 benchmark dose-response 完美单调（ρ=1.0），cross-benchmark gradient\n4\t  Pearson r=0.997。Reviewers 认可这一梯度作为 unified explanation：推理链越长，importance score 在低\n5\t  sparsity phase 的判别力崩塌越严重，compound interaction 被放大得越多——random/recency 不受此影响。Triple\n6\t  dissociation（importance有gradient / random弱或NS / recency NS）在 GPQA 上同样成立，cross-architecture\n7\t  specificity差异被视为 interesting finding 而非 confound。\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n10\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n11\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.20, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n12\t    segmentation\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    n_problems: 198\n15\t    median_difference: 2.85\n16\t    ii_low_median: 2.92\n17\t    ii_mid_median: 0.38\n18\t    ii_high_median: 0.035\n19\t    median_ratio_low_high: 83.4\n20\t    wilcoxon_p: 3.2e-34\n21\t    cohens_dz: 0.92\n22\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n23\t    - 2.41\n24\t    - 3.35\n25\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n26\t    gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n27\t    perplexity_low_both: 42.8\n28\t    perplexity_high_both: 3.15\n29\t    phase_stats_high_n_tokens: 479658\n30\t    phase_stats_low_n_tokens: 465085\n31\t  result_rationale: GPQA 问题的推理链平均长度是 MATH-500 的 2.0-2.5×（GPQA ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500\n32\t    ~2500 tokens）。更长的推理链意味着 low-sparsity phase 占比更大、attention score 判别力在该 phase 内承受更多累积退化。s020\n33\t    时 head pruning 已经开始削弱 importance score 的 Gini coefficient（DS s020 global Gini\n34\t    delta = -0.0404），在 GPQA 更长的 low-sparsity phase 内，这种累积 discrimination collapse\n35\t    导致更多 token 被错误 evict，II 放大为 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 ~2.35× (2.85/1.215)。该倍率略低于 s015\n36\t    的 2.42× 是因为 s020 compound interaction 已进入非线性区间、GPQA 的超长序列在 KV cache 层面有 marginally\n37\t    更多 recovery redundancy。\n38\t  tables:\n39\t  - name: 'Table: GPQA Phase Gradient s020'\n40\t    content: 'Phase     | II median | 95% CI        | n_segments\n41\t\n42\t      high      | 0.035     | [0.028, 0.042]| ~6200\n43\t\n44\t      mid       | 0.38      | [0.32, 0.45]  | ~2200\n45\t\n46\t      low       | 2.92      | [2.55, 3.35]  | ~5100\n47\t\n48\t      '\n49\t  figures_description:\n50\t  - GPQA dose-response curve at s020 overlaid with MATH-500 s020 (normalized), showing\n51\t    GPQA's steeper gradient\n52\t  analysis: s020 确认 GPQA phase gradient 强于 MATH-500 同 sparsity（median_diff 2.85 vs\n53\t    1.215, ratio 2.35×）。effect size d_z=0.92 在 n=198 下功效充分（power>0.999）。与 s015 结果合并确认单调递增趋势：0.947→2.85。\n54\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n55\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n56\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.25, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n57\t    segmentation\n58\t  expected_results:\n59\t    n_problems: 198\n60\t    median_difference: 7.2\n61\t    ii_low_median: 7.45\n62\t    ii_mid_median: 1.52\n63\t    ii_high_median: 0.098\n64\t    median_ratio_low_high: 76.0\n65\t    wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-40\n66\t    cohens_dz: 1.08\n67\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n68\t    - 6.15\n69\t    - 8.4\n70\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n71\t    gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n72\t    perplexity_low_both: 88.5\n73\t    perplexity_mid_both: 18.6\n74\t    perplexity_high_both: 4.82\n75\t  result_rationale: s025 是 discrimination collapse 加速的临界区间——MATH-500 上 Gini delta\n76\t    从 s020 的 -0.040 跳到 s025 的 -0.065（61% 增幅）。GPQA 更长推理链在此 sparsity 承受更多 cascade failure：每个被错误\n77\t    evict 的 token 影响后续更多 token 的 attention pattern，链越长 cascade 越深。GPQA/MATH-500 乘数从\n78\t    s015 的 2.42× 衰减至 s025 的 1.81×（7.2/3.986），因为 MATH-500 在 s025 自身已处于强 interaction\n79\t    区间（median_diff 3.99），两者开始向共同的 'severe degradation' 上界收敛。Cohen's d_z 达到 1.08 表明\n80\t    phase gradient 在此 sparsity 处于最强判别力。\n81\t  tables:\n82\t  - name: 'Table: GPQA Phase Gradient s025'\n83\t    content: 'Phase     | II median | 95% CI         | Perplexity (both)\n84\t\n85\t      high      | 0.098     | [0.072, 0.128] | 4.82\n86\t\n87\t      mid       | 1.52      | [1.18, 1.92]   | 18.6\n88\t\n89\t      low       | 7.45      | [6.30, 8.75]   | 88.5\n90\t\n91\t      '\n92\t  figures_description:\n93\t  - Phase × sparsity heatmap for GPQA showing s025 as the inflection point where low-phase\n94\t    II exceeds 5.0\n95\t  analysis: s025 是 paper narrative 的关键支撑点：GPQA median_diff=7.2 明显超越 MATH-500 s025\n96\t    的 3.99（1.8×），而 MATH-500 的 s025 已经是该 benchmark 的强效应区间。这证实了推理链长度调制 compound severity\n97\t    的核心假设。\n98\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n99\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n100\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.30, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n101\t    segmentation\n102\t  expected_results:\n103\t    n_problems: 198\n104\t    median_difference: 12.0\n105\t    ii_low_median: 12.35\n106\t    ii_mid_median: 3.28\n107\t    ii_high_median: 0.18\n108\t    median_ratio_low_high: 68.6\n109\t    wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-42\n110\t    cohens_dz: 1.15\n111\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n112\t    - 10.2\n113\t    - 14.8\n114\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n115\t    gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n116\t    perplexity_low_both: 185.3\n117\t    perplexity_mid_both: 42.6\n118\t    perplexity_high_both: 7.15\n119\t    gpqa_dose_response_rho: 1.0\n120\t    gpqa_dose_response_perm_p: 0.0417\n121\t  result_rationale: s030 是 extreme sparsity，30% head 被 prune 后 importance score 的判别力严重崩塌（DS\n122\t    Gini delta = -0.0806）。GPQA 的超长推理链（~6000 tokens）在 low-sparsity phase 内需要 attention\n123\t    维持大量远距离依赖，而 s030 pruning 使得 importance scoring 近乎随机——大量 critical token 被错误 evict，产生\n124\t    catastrophic cascade。median_diff=12.0 处于 best tier 的 [6, 15] 中心，GPQA/MATH-500\n125\t    乘数降至 1.41×（12.0/8.48），反映两者在极端 sparsity 下均接近 ceiling（模型在 low phase 已几乎完全 degenerate，进一步加剧的空间有限）。median_ratio_low_high\n126\t    从 s015 的 75.2 降至 68.6，因 high phase 的 II 也开始上升（floor effect 被突破）。\n127\t  tables:\n128\t  - name: 'Table: GPQA Full Dose-Response (importance)'\n129\t    content: 'Sparsity | median_diff | 95% CI        | d_z  | Wilcoxon p\n130\t\n131\t      s015     | 0.947       | [0.88, 1.03]  | 0.81 | 1.4e-29\n132\t\n133\t      s020     | 2.85        | [2.41, 3.35]  | 0.92 | 3.2e-34\n134\t\n135\t      s025     | 7.2         | [6.15, 8.40]  | 1.08 | 8.1e-40\n136\t\n137\t      s030     | 12.0        | [10.2, 14.8]  | 1.15 | 2.5e-42\n138\t\n139\t      '\n140\t  figures_description:\n141\t  - Three-benchmark dose-response comparison (GSM8K / MATH-500 / GPQA) with 95% CI\n142\t    ribbons, showing GPQA's steepest gradient\n143\t  - Cross-benchmark gradient correlation scatter plot (r=0.997)\n144\t  analysis: s030 完成 GPQA 四点 dose-response 曲线，Spearman ρ=1.0 确认完美单调性。GPQA gradient\n145\t    在绝对值上超越 MATH-500（12.0 vs 8.48），且 d_z 更大（1.15 vs 0.94），证实推理链长度正相关于 compound severity\n146\t    的 phase gradient 强度。\n147\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n148\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n149\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.20, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n150\t    segmentation\n151\t  expected_results:\n152\t    n_problems: 198\n153\t    median_difference: 0.038\n154\t    ii_low_median: 0.052\n155\t    ii_mid_median: 0.041\n156\t    ii_high_median: 0.028\n157\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.215\n158\t    cohens_dz: 0.065\n159\t    significant_bonferroni: false\n160\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n161\t    - -0.018\n162\t    - 0.095\n163\t    phase_gradient_direction: near-flat\n164\t  result_rationale: Random masking 不依赖 attention score，因此不受 discrimination collapse\n165\t    影响。s020 random 在 MATH-500 n=500 上已是 NS（median=0.032, p=0.28），GPQA 上同样 NS。虽然 GPQA\n166\t    推理链更长（更多 token 被随机 evict），但随机 eviction 的 damage 在各 phase 内均匀分布——不存在 'low phase\n167\t    更脆弱' 的选择性放大。median_diff=0.038 略高于 MATH-500 的 0.032 仅反映 GPQA 序列更长时随机删除的绝对影响略大，但远未达显著性。\n168\t  tables:\n169\t  - name: 'Table: GPQA Random s020 Phase Breakdown'\n170\t    content: 'Phase | II median | 95% CI          | Interpretation\n171\t\n172\t      high  | 0.028     | [-0.005, 0.062] | NS\n173\t\n174\t      mid   | 0.041     | [0.012, 0.078]  | NS\n175\t\n176\t      low   | 0.052     | [0.015, 0.098]  | NS\n177\t\n178\t      '\n179\t  figures_description:\n180\t  - 'Strategy comparison at s020: importance shows steep gradient (d_z=0.92) vs random\n181\t    flat (d_z=0.065)'\n182\t  analysis: 'Random s020 NS 确认 phase gradient 不是 phase segmentation artifact。如果 gradient\n183\t    是 segmentation 本身的偏差，random masking 也应显示类似 gradient——实际 NS 排除此可能。imp/rand ratio\n184\t    在 s020: 2.85/0.038 = 75×（MATH-500 同 sparsity 约 38×），GPQA 的 strategy specificity\n185\t    更强。'\n186\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n187\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n188\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n189\t    segmentation\n190\t  expected_results:\n191\t    n_problems: 198\n192\t    median_difference: 0.42\n193\t    ii_low_median: 0.58\n194\t    ii_mid_median: 0.39\n195\t    ii_high_median: 0.22\n196\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.0032\n197\t    cohens_dz: 0.18\n198\t    significant_bonferroni: true\n199\t    bonferroni_p: 0.0128\n200\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n201\t    - 0.15\n202\t    - 0.72\n203\t    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 17.1\n204\t  result_rationale: s025 是 random masking 的 onset threshold（MATH-500 上 DS random s025\n205\t    median=0.257, Bonferroni p=0.006）。GPQA 上 random 同样在 s025 开始显著（p=0.003），但 effect\n206\t    size 极小（d_z=0.18, small）。这符合理论预期：当 25% head 被 prune 时，即使 random eviction 也会因 redundancy\n207\t    不足导致少量 phase-dependent damage（low phase 的长距离依赖更脆弱）。但 importance/random ratio=17.1×\n208\t    表明 importance eviction 的 phase gradient 远强于 random 的微弱 gradient——两者 mechanism\n209\t    根本不同：importance 是 discrimination collapse 驱动的系统性偏差放大，random 是纯粹的 redundancy depletion。\n210\t  tables:\n211\t  - name: 'Table: Strategy Specificity at s025 (GPQA)'\n212\t    content: 'Strategy   | median_diff | d_z  | p (Bonf) | Interpretation\n213\t\n214\t      Importance | 7.2         | 1.08 | <1e-39   | Strong gradient\n215\t\n216\t      Random     | 0.42        | 0.18 | 0.013    | Weak gradient\n217\t\n218\t      Ratio      | 17.1×       | 6.0× | —        | Strategy-specific\n219\t\n220\t      '\n221\t  figures_description:\n222\t  - 'Paired comparison: importance vs random phase gradient at s025, violin plot showing\n223\t    distribution overlap'\n224\t  analysis: GPQA s025 imp/rand ratio=17.1× 与 MATH-500 的 15.5× 高度一致（略强），支持 GPQA≥MATH-500\n225\t    specificity 叙事。Random 虽显著但 d_z 仅 0.18，不构成对 importance-specific 叙事的挑战。\n226\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n227\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n228\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.30, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n229\t    segmentation\n230\t  expected_results:\n231\t    n_problems: 198\n232\t    median_difference: 0.7\n233\t    ii_low_median: 1.05\n234\t    ii_mid_median: 0.68\n235\t    ii_high_median: 0.42\n236\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.00085\n237\t    cohens_dz: 0.22\n238\t    significant_bonferroni: true\n239\t    bonferroni_p: 0.0034\n240\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n241\t    - 0.28\n242\t    - 1.18\n243\t    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 17.1\n244\t    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_overall: 17.1\n245\t  result_rationale: 's030 extreme sparsity 下 random masking 产生可测量的 phase gradient（d_z=0.22），因为\n246\t    30% pruning 后即使 random eviction 也面临严重 redundancy 不足——low phase 的长距离 token 依赖被破坏概率更高。但\n247\t    importance/random ratio 保持 17.1×，一致于 s025。这与 MATH-500 模式一致（DS n=500: imp_s030=8.48,\n248\t    rand_s030=0.51, ratio=16.6×）。GPQA 的 ratio 略高于 MATH-500（17.1 vs 16.6）验证了核心假设：推理链越长，discrimination\n249\t    collapse 在 importance eviction 中的放大效应越强，而 random 不受此影响，导致 specificity 随 reasoning\n250\t    complexity 递增。'\n251\t  tables:\n252\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Strategy Specificity Gradient'\n253\t    content: 'Benchmark | Reasoning depth | Imp/Rand ratio (s030) | Interpretation\n254\t\n255\t      GSM8K     | Short (~500 tok)| 2.8×                  | Weak specificity\n256\t\n257\t      MATH-500  | Medium (~2500)  | 16.6×                 | Strong specificity\n258\t\n259\t      GPQA      | Long (~6000)    | 17.1×                 | Strongest specificity\n260\t\n261\t      '\n262\t  - name: 'Table: GPQA Complete Random Results'\n263\t    content: 'Sparsity | median_diff | d_z  | p (Bonf) | Significant\n264\t\n265\t      s020     | 0.038       | 0.07 | 0.86     | No\n266\t\n267\t      s025     | 0.42        | 0.18 | 0.013    | Yes (weak)\n268\t\n269\t      s030     | 0.70        | 0.22 | 0.003    | Yes (weak)\n270\t\n271\t      '\n272\t  figures_description:\n273\t  - Three-benchmark specificity bar chart showing monotonic increase in imp/rand ratio\n274\t    with reasoning depth\n275\t  - Strategy × phase × benchmark 3D interaction plot (key paper figure)\n276\t  analysis: GPQA random s030 完成 strategy specificity 分析。imp/rand=17.1× 略超 MATH-500\n277\t    的 16.6×，但差异不大（可能在 CI 内重叠），核心贡献在于方向一致：GPQA ≥ MATH-500 >> GSM8K。这支持 unified explanation：推理链长度调制\n278\t    discrimination collapse 的累积深度，从而调制 strategy specificity。\n279\t- name: gpqa_cross_benchmark_gradient_synthesis\n280\t  plan_id: cross_benchmark_synthesis\n281\t  description: 三 benchmark (GSM8K/MATH-500/GPQA) phase gradient 比较与 reasoning-complexity\n282\t    correlation 分析\n283\t  expected_results:\n284\t    cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.997\n285\t    specificity_gradient_monotonic: true\n286\t    specificity_ordering: GPQA(17.1×) > MATH-500(16.6×) > GSM8K(2.8×)\n287\t    dose_response_rho_gsm8k: 1.0\n288\t    dose_response_rho_math500: 1.0\n289\t    dose_response_rho_gpqa: 1.0\n290\t    gradient_magnitude_ordering: GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K at each sparsity level\n291\t    normalized_gradient_shape_correlation: 0.997\n292\t    reasoning_depth_proxy:\n293\t      gsm8k_avg_tokens: 500\n294\t      math500_avg_tokens: 2500\n295\t      gpqa_avg_tokens: 6000\n296\t    specificity_vs_depth_spearman: 1.0\n297\t  result_rationale: 三个 benchmark 的 reasoning depth 形成自然梯度（GSM8K ~500 tokens, MATH-500\n298\t    ~2500 tokens, GPQA ~6000 tokens），且 compound severity 的 phase gradient 和 strategy\n299\t    specificity 均与此深度正相关。Pearson r=0.997 来自三个 benchmark 在每个 sparsity level 的 importance\n300\t    median_diff 之间的相关性：它们的 dose-response 曲线形状高度相似（都是单调递增、sub-exponential growth），仅在\n301\t    magnitude 上按 reasoning depth 缩放。Strategy specificity（imp/rand ratio）从 GSM8K 的\n302\t    2.8× 到 MATH-500 的 16.6× 到 GPQA 的 17.1×，Spearman ρ=1.0。MATH-500 和 GPQA 的 specificity\n303\t    接近（16.6 vs 17.1）而非 GPQA 远超 MATH-500，这是因为 specificity 的增长可能有 ceiling——一旦 reasoning\n304\t    depth 超过某阈值（~2000 tokens），discrimination collapse 的 phase-selective 放大已接近饱和。GSM8K\n305\t    的显著偏低则因为短链推理中 attention score 的判别负担本身较轻，collapse 的影响被稀释。\n306\t  tables:\n307\t  - name: 'Table: Three-Benchmark Gradient Comparison (Importance)'\n308\t    content: 'Sparsity | GSM8K (DS) | MATH-500 (DS) | GPQA (DS) | GPQA/MATH ratio\n309\t\n310\t      s015     | 0.241      | 0.391          | 0.947     | 2.42×\n311\t\n312\t      s020     | 0.740      | 1.215          | 2.85      | 2.35×\n313\t\n314\t      s025     | 1.992      | 3.986          | 7.2       | 1.81×\n315\t\n316\t      s030     | 4.682      | 8.481          | 12.0      | 1.41×\n317\t\n318\t      '\n319\t  - name: 'Table: Strategy Specificity vs Reasoning Complexity'\n320\t    content: 'Benchmark | Avg reasoning tokens | Imp/Rand ratio (s030) | Onset threshold\n321\t\n322\t      GSM8K     | ~500                 | 2.8×                  | s015+ (all sig)\n323\t\n324\t      MATH-500  | ~2500                | 16.6×                 | s025 (random onset)\n325\t\n326\t      GPQA      | ~6000                | 17.1×                 | s025 (random onset)\n327\t\n328\t      '\n329\t  figures_description:\n330\t  - 'Fig 5 (main paper): Three-benchmark dose-response overlay with 95% CI ribbons,\n331\t    log-scale y-axis, showing convergent shape with depth-scaled magnitude'\n332\t  - 'Fig 6 (main paper): Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) as function of reasoning\n333\t    depth, with GSM8K/MATH-500/GPQA as data points'\n334\t  analysis: Cross-benchmark synthesis 是 paper 的 capstone finding。三 benchmark 形成 reasoning-complexity\n335\t    梯度解释：(1) Phase gradient 绝对值随 reasoning depth 递增（unified by discrimination collapse\n336\t    mechanism）；(2) Strategy specificity 随 reasoning depth 递增（GPQA≥MATH>>GSM8K），因为更长链→更深的\n337\t    attention score 判别负担→collapse 时偏差累积更严重→importance eviction 退化更极端。(3) Random/recency\n338\t    不受此影响→形成 triple dissociation。Reviewers 在 best tier 下认可这一 unified explanation 具备\n339\t    sufficient mechanism evidence。\n340\t- name: expected_reviewer_assessment\n341\t  plan_id: reviewer_synthesis\n342\t  description: Best tier 下预期审稿评分与关键论证\n343\t  expected_results:\n344\t    expected_reviewer_avg_score: 3.75\n345\t    novelty_score: 4.0\n346\t    soundness_score: 3.5\n347\t    significance_score: 3.5\n348\t    presentation_score: 4.0\n349\t    reviewer_1_score: 4.0\n350\t    reviewer_2_score: 3.5\n351\t    reviewer_3_score: 3.75\n352\t    meta_reviewer_recommendation: weak accept\n353\t  result_rationale: Best tier 下，论文具备以下强项让 reviewers 给出 3.5-4.0 分：(1) Triple dissociation（importance/random/recency）提供了超越\n354\t    correlation 的 mechanism discrimination evidence，novelty 得分 4.0；(2) 三 benchmark\n355\t    × 三架构的泛化验证充分（但 7B-only 是明确 limitation）；(3) Recency control 作为 novel experimental\n356\t    design contribution 无先例，方法论贡献被认可；(4) Cross-benchmark gradient 提供了 unified explanation\n357\t    而非零散 findings。主要扣分点：(a) 7B models only（significance 扣 0.5）；(b) 无 throughput/latency\n358\t    数据（practical impact 扣 0.25）；(c) entropy collapse 在 Qwen 上不一致（mechanism 完整性扣 0.25）。Architecture-dependent\n359\t    specificity 被视为 interesting nuance 而非 confound——因为 within-importance gradient\n360\t    在所有架构上 consistently large（d_z>0.8），差异仅在 imp/rand ratio 的 magnitude。\n361\t  tables:\n362\t  - name: 'Table: Anticipated Reviewer Score Breakdown'\n363\t    content: 'Criterion      | R1   | R2   | R3   | Rationale\n364\t\n365\t      Novelty        | 4.0  | 4.0  | 4.0  | Triple dissociation + cross-benchmark\n366\t      gradient novel\n367\t\n368\t      Soundness      | 3.5  | 3.5  | 3.5  | Strong stats, minor gap (QW entropy)\n369\t\n370\t      Significance   | 3.5  | 3.0  | 3.5  | 7B-only limits generalizability claim\n371\t\n372\t      Presentation   | 4.0  | 4.0  | 4.0  | Clear narrative, good figures\n373\t\n374\t      Overall        | 4.0  | 3.5  | 3.75 | —\n375\t\n376\t      '\n377\t  figures_description: []\n378\t  analysis: Best tier 预期 avg 3.75，meta-reviewer weak accept。关键 swing factor 是 R2 是否被\n379\t    '7B-only' limitation 影响到 3.0 overall。Rebuttal 策略应预备：(1) 'scale limitation' 回应准备\n380\t    LLaMA-8B 跨架构结果 + 计算资源声明；(2) 'practical impact' 回应准备 c5b pilot 结果 + future work\n381\t    framing。\n382\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6cd8e41-5873-40ec-aa2c-9e61f1b94abd","uuid":"77b72cab-fe61-4a6f-b6b7-26a1299702ac","timestamp":"2026-05-17T03:52:36.782Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T032843/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: GPQA 全面复现 phase-dependent compound severity，且 strategy specificity\n  强于 MATH-500（17× vs 15-17×），形成 reasoning-complexity 梯度（GSM8K 2.3-3.8× < MATH-500\n  15-17× < GPQA 17×）。三 benchmark dose-response 完美单调（ρ=1.0），cross-benchmark gradient\n  Pearson r=0.997。Reviewers 认可这一梯度作为 unified explanation：推理链越长，importance score 在低\n  sparsity phase 的判别力崩塌越严重，compound interaction 被放大得越多——random/recency 不受此影响。Triple\n  dissociation（importance有gradient / random弱或NS / recency NS）在 GPQA 上同样成立，cross-architecture\n  specificity差异被视为 interesting finding 而非 confound。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.20, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n    segmentation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    median_difference: 2.85\n    ii_low_median: 2.92\n    ii_mid_median: 0.38\n    ii_high_median: 0.035\n    median_ratio_low_high: 83.4\n    wilcoxon_p: 3.2e-34\n    cohens_dz: 0.92\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 2.41\n    - 3.35\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n    perplexity_low_both: 42.8\n    perplexity_high_both: 3.15\n    phase_stats_high_n_tokens: 479658\n    phase_stats_low_n_tokens: 465085\n  result_rationale: GPQA 问题的推理链平均长度是 MATH-500 的 2.0-2.5×（GPQA ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500\n    ~2500 tokens）。更长的推理链意味着 low-sparsity phase 占比更大、attention score 判别力在该 phase 内承受更多累积退化。s020\n    时 head pruning 已经开始削弱 importance score 的 Gini coefficient（DS s020 global Gini\n    delta = -0.0404），在 GPQA 更长的 low-sparsity phase 内，这种累积 discrimination collapse\n    导致更多 token 被错误 evict，II 放大为 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 ~2.35× (2.85/1.215)。该倍率略低于 s015\n    的 2.42× 是因为 s020 compound interaction 已进入非线性区间、GPQA 的超长序列在 KV cache 层面有 marginally\n    更多 recovery redundancy。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GPQA Phase Gradient s020'\n    content: 'Phase     | II median | 95% CI        | n_segments\n\n      high      | 0.035     | [0.028, 0.042]| ~6200\n\n      mid       | 0.38      | [0.32, 0.45]  | ~2200\n\n      low       | 2.92      | [2.55, 3.35]  | ~5100\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - GPQA dose-response curve at s020 overlaid with MATH-500 s020 (normalized), showing\n    GPQA's steeper gradient\n  analysis: s020 确认 GPQA phase gradient 强于 MATH-500 同 sparsity（median_diff 2.85 vs\n    1.215, ratio 2.35×）。effect size d_z=0.92 在 n=198 下功效充分（power>0.999）。与 s015 结果合并确认单调递增趋势：0.947→2.85。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.25, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n    segmentation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    median_difference: 7.2\n    ii_low_median: 7.45\n    ii_mid_median: 1.52\n    ii_high_median: 0.098\n    median_ratio_low_high: 76.0\n    wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-40\n    cohens_dz: 1.08\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 6.15\n    - 8.4\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n    perplexity_low_both: 88.5\n    perplexity_mid_both: 18.6\n    perplexity_high_both: 4.82\n  result_rationale: s025 是 discrimination collapse 加速的临界区间——MATH-500 上 Gini delta\n    从 s020 的 -0.040 跳到 s025 的 -0.065（61% 增幅）。GPQA 更长推理链在此 sparsity 承受更多 cascade failure：每个被错误\n    evict 的 token 影响后续更多 token 的 attention pattern，链越长 cascade 越深。GPQA/MATH-500 乘数从\n    s015 的 2.42× 衰减至 s025 的 1.81×（7.2/3.986），因为 MATH-500 在 s025 自身已处于强 interaction\n    区间（median_diff 3.99），两者开始向共同的 'severe degradation' 上界收敛。Cohen's d_z 达到 1.08 表明\n    phase gradient 在此 sparsity 处于最强判别力。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GPQA Phase Gradient s025'\n    content: 'Phase     | II median | 95% CI         | Perplexity (both)\n\n      high      | 0.098     | [0.072, 0.128] | 4.82\n\n      mid       | 1.52      | [1.18, 1.92]   | 18.6\n\n      low       | 7.45      | [6.30, 8.75]   | 88.5\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Phase × sparsity heatmap for GPQA showing s025 as the inflection point where low-phase\n    II exceeds 5.0\n  analysis: s025 是 paper narrative 的关键支撑点：GPQA median_diff=7.2 明显超越 MATH-500 s025\n    的 3.99（1.8×），而 MATH-500 的 s025 已经是该 benchmark 的强效应区间。这证实了推理链长度调制 compound severity\n    的核心假设。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.30, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n    segmentation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    median_difference: 12.0\n    ii_low_median: 12.35\n    ii_mid_median: 3.28\n    ii_high_median: 0.18\n    median_ratio_low_high: 68.6\n    wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-42\n    cohens_dz: 1.15\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 10.2\n    - 14.8\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n    perplexity_low_both: 185.3\n    perplexity_mid_both: 42.6\n    perplexity_high_both: 7.15\n    gpqa_dose_response_rho: 1.0\n    gpqa_dose_response_perm_p: 0.0417\n  result_rationale: s030 是 extreme sparsity，30% head 被 prune 后 importance score 的判别力严重崩塌（DS\n    Gini delta = -0.0806）。GPQA 的超长推理链（~6000 tokens）在 low-sparsity phase 内需要 attention\n    维持大量远距离依赖，而 s030 pruning 使得 importance scoring 近乎随机——大量 critical token 被错误 evict，产生\n    catastrophic cascade。median_diff=12.0 处于 best tier 的 [6, 15] 中心，GPQA/MATH-500\n    乘数降至 1.41×（12.0/8.48），反映两者在极端 sparsity 下均接近 ceiling（模型在 low phase 已几乎完全 degenerate，进一步加剧的空间有限）。median_ratio_low_high\n    从 s015 的 75.2 降至 68.6，因 high phase 的 II 也开始上升（floor effect 被突破）。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GPQA Full Dose-Response (importance)'\n    content: 'Sparsity | median_diff | 95% CI        | d_z  | Wilcoxon p\n\n      s015     | 0.947       | [0.88, 1.03]  | 0.81 | 1.4e-29\n\n      s020     | 2.85        | [2.41, 3.35]  | 0.92 | 3.2e-34\n\n      s025     | 7.2         | [6.15, 8.40]  | 1.08 | 8.1e-40\n\n      s030     | 12.0        | [10.2, 14.8]  | 1.15 | 2.5e-42\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Three-benchmark dose-response comparison (GSM8K / MATH-500 / GPQA) with 95% CI\n    ribbons, showing GPQA's steepest gradient\n  - Cross-benchmark gradient correlation scatter plot (r=0.997)\n  analysis: s030 完成 GPQA 四点 dose-response 曲线，Spearman ρ=1.0 确认完美单调性。GPQA gradient\n    在绝对值上超越 MATH-500（12.0 vs 8.48），且 d_z 更大（1.15 vs 0.94），证实推理链长度正相关于 compound severity\n    的 phase gradient 强度。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.20, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n    segmentation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    median_difference: 0.038\n    ii_low_median: 0.052\n    ii_mid_median: 0.041\n    ii_high_median: 0.028\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.215\n    cohens_dz: 0.065\n    significant_bonferroni: false\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - -0.018\n    - 0.095\n    phase_gradient_direction: near-flat\n  result_rationale: Random masking 不依赖 attention score，因此不受 discrimination collapse\n    影响。s020 random 在 MATH-500 n=500 上已是 NS（median=0.032, p=0.28），GPQA 上同样 NS。虽然 GPQA\n    推理链更长（更多 token 被随机 evict），但随机 eviction 的 damage 在各 phase 内均匀分布——不存在 'low phase\n    更脆弱' 的选择性放大。median_diff=0.038 略高于 MATH-500 的 0.032 仅反映 GPQA 序列更长时随机删除的绝对影响略大，但远未达显著性。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GPQA Random s020 Phase Breakdown'\n    content: 'Phase | II median | 95% CI          | Interpretation\n\n      high  | 0.028     | [-0.005, 0.062] | NS\n\n      mid   | 0.041     | [0.012, 0.078]  | NS\n\n      low   | 0.052     | [0.015, 0.098]  | NS\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Strategy comparison at s020: importance shows steep gradient (d_z=0.92) vs random\n    flat (d_z=0.065)'\n  analysis: 'Random s020 NS 确认 phase gradient 不是 phase segmentation artifact。如果 gradient\n    是 segmentation 本身的偏差，random masking 也应显示类似 gradient——实际 NS 排除此可能。imp/rand ratio\n    在 s020: 2.85/0.038 = 75×（MATH-500 同 sparsity 约 38×），GPQA 的 strategy specificity\n    更强。'\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n    segmentation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    median_difference: 0.42\n    ii_low_median: 0.58\n    ii_mid_median: 0.39\n    ii_high_median: 0.22\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.0032\n    cohens_dz: 0.18\n    significant_bonferroni: true\n    bonferroni_p: 0.0128\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.15\n    - 0.72\n    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 17.1\n  result_rationale: s025 是 random masking 的 onset threshold（MATH-500 上 DS random s025\n    median=0.257, Bonferroni p=0.006）。GPQA 上 random 同样在 s025 开始显著（p=0.003），但 effect\n    size 极小（d_z=0.18, small）。这符合理论预期：当 25% head 被 prune 时，即使 random eviction 也会因 redundancy\n    不足导致少量 phase-dependent damage（low phase 的长距离依赖更脆弱）。但 importance/random ratio=17.1×\n    表明 importance eviction 的 phase gradient 远强于 random 的微弱 gradient——两者 mechanism\n    根本不同：importance 是 discrimination collapse 驱动的系统性偏差放大，random 是纯粹的 redundancy depletion。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Strategy Specificity at s025 (GPQA)'\n    content: 'Strategy   | median_diff | d_z  | p (Bonf) | Interpretation\n\n      Importance | 7.2         | 1.08 | <1e-39   | Strong gradient\n\n      Random     | 0.42        | 0.18 | 0.013    | Weak gradient\n\n      Ratio      | 17.1×       | 6.0× | —        | Strategy-specific\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired comparison: importance vs random phase gradient at s025, violin plot showing\n    distribution overlap'\n  analysis: GPQA s025 imp/rand ratio=17.1× 与 MATH-500 的 15.5× 高度一致（略强），支持 GPQA≥MATH-500\n    specificity 叙事。Random 虽显著但 d_z 仅 0.18，不构成对 importance-specific 叙事的挑战。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.30, n=198, quantile 3-phase\n    segmentation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    median_difference: 0.7\n    ii_low_median: 1.05\n    ii_mid_median: 0.68\n    ii_high_median: 0.42\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.00085\n    cohens_dz: 0.22\n    significant_bonferroni: true\n    bonferroni_p: 0.0034\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.28\n    - 1.18\n    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 17.1\n    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_overall: 17.1\n  result_rationale: 's030 extreme sparsity 下 random masking 产生可测量的 phase gradient（d_z=0.22），因为\n    30% pruning 后即使 random eviction 也面临严重 redundancy 不足——low phase 的长距离 token 依赖被破坏概率更高。但\n    importance/random ratio 保持 17.1×，一致于 s025。这与 MATH-500 模式一致（DS n=500: imp_s030=8.48,\n    rand_s030=0.51, ratio=16.6×）。GPQA 的 ratio 略高于 MATH-500（17.1 vs 16.6）验证了核心假设：推理链越长，discrimination\n    collapse 在 importance eviction 中的放大效应越强，而 random 不受此影响，导致 specificity 随 reasoning\n    complexity 递增。'\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Strategy Specificity Gradient'\n    content: 'Benchmark | Reasoning depth | Imp/Rand ratio (s030) | Interpretation\n\n      GSM8K     | Short (~500 tok)| 2.8×                  | Weak specificity\n\n      MATH-500  | Medium (~2500)  | 16.6×                 | Strong specificity\n\n      GPQA      | Long (~6000)    | 17.1×                 | Strongest specificity\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: GPQA Complete Random Results'\n    content: 'Sparsity | median_diff | d_z  | p (Bonf) | Significant\n\n      s020     | 0.038       | 0.07 | 0.86     | No\n\n      s025     | 0.42        | 0.18 | 0.013    | Yes (weak)\n\n      s030     | 0.70        | 0.22 | 0.003    | Yes (weak)\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Three-benchmark specificity bar chart showing monotonic increase in imp/rand ratio\n    with reasoning depth\n  - Strategy × phase × benchmark 3D interaction plot (key paper figure)\n  analysis: GPQA random s030 完成 strategy specificity 分析。imp/rand=17.1× 略超 MATH-500\n    的 16.6×，但差异不大（可能在 CI 内重叠），核心贡献在于方向一致：GPQA ≥ MATH-500 >> GSM8K。这支持 unified explanation：推理链长度调制\n    discrimination collapse 的累积深度，从而调制 strategy specificity。\n- name: gpqa_cross_benchmark_gradient_synthesis\n  plan_id: cross_benchmark_synthesis\n  description: 三 benchmark (GSM8K/MATH-500/GPQA) phase gradient 比较与 reasoning-complexity\n    correlation 分析\n  expected_results:\n    cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.997\n    specificity_gradient_monotonic: true\n    specificity_ordering: GPQA(17.1×) > MATH-500(16.6×) > GSM8K(2.8×)\n    dose_response_rho_gsm8k: 1.0\n    dose_response_rho_math500: 1.0\n    dose_response_rho_gpqa: 1.0\n    gradient_magnitude_ordering: GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K at each sparsity level\n    normalized_gradient_shape_correlation: 0.997\n    reasoning_depth_proxy:\n      gsm8k_avg_tokens: 500\n      math500_avg_tokens: 2500\n      gpqa_avg_tokens: 6000\n    specificity_vs_depth_spearman: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 三个 benchmark 的 reasoning depth 形成自然梯度（GSM8K ~500 tokens, MATH-500\n    ~2500 tokens, GPQA ~6000 tokens），且 compound severity 的 phase gradient 和 strategy\n    specificity 均与此深度正相关。Pearson r=0.997 来自三个 benchmark 在每个 sparsity level 的 importance\n    median_diff 之间的相关性：它们的 dose-response 曲线形状高度相似（都是单调递增、sub-exponential growth），仅在\n    magnitude 上按 reasoning depth 缩放。Strategy specificity（imp/rand ratio）从 GSM8K 的\n    2.8× 到 MATH-500 的 16.6× 到 GPQA 的 17.1×，Spearman ρ=1.0。MATH-500 和 GPQA 的 specificity\n    接近（16.6 vs 17.1）而非 GPQA 远超 MATH-500，这是因为 specificity 的增长可能有 ceiling——一旦 reasoning\n    depth 超过某阈值（~2000 tokens），discrimination collapse 的 phase-selective 放大已接近饱和。GSM8K\n    的显著偏低则因为短链推理中 attention score 的判别负担本身较轻，collapse 的影响被稀释。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Three-Benchmark Gradient Comparison (Importance)'\n    content: 'Sparsity | GSM8K (DS) | MATH-500 (DS) | GPQA (DS) | GPQA/MATH ratio\n\n      s015     | 0.241      | 0.391          | 0.947     | 2.42×\n\n      s020     | 0.740      | 1.215          | 2.85      | 2.35×\n\n      s025     | 1.992      | 3.986          | 7.2       | 1.81×\n\n      s030     | 4.682      | 8.481          | 12.0      | 1.41×\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Strategy Specificity vs Reasoning Complexity'\n    content: 'Benchmark | Avg reasoning tokens | Imp/Rand ratio (s030) | Onset threshold\n\n      GSM8K     | ~500                 | 2.8×                  | s015+ (all sig)\n\n      MATH-500  | ~2500                | 16.6×                 | s025 (random onset)\n\n      GPQA      | ~6000                | 17.1×                 | s025 (random onset)\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5 (main paper): Three-benchmark dose-response overlay with 95% CI ribbons,\n    log-scale y-axis, showing convergent shape with depth-scaled magnitude'\n  - 'Fig 6 (main paper): Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) as function of reasoning\n    depth, with GSM8K/MATH-500/GPQA as data points'\n  analysis: Cross-benchmark synthesis 是 paper 的 capstone finding。三 benchmark 形成 reasoning-complexity\n    梯度解释：(1) Phase gradient 绝对值随 reasoning depth 递增（unified by discrimination collapse\n    mechanism）；(2) Strategy specificity 随 reasoning depth 递增（GPQA≥MATH>>GSM8K），因为更长链→更深的\n    attention score 判别负担→collapse 时偏差累积更严重→importance eviction 退化更极端。(3) Random/recency\n    不受此影响→形成 triple dissociation。Reviewers 在 best tier 下认可这一 unified explanation 具备\n    sufficient mechanism evidence。\n- name: expected_reviewer_assessment\n  plan_id: reviewer_synthesis\n  description: Best tier 下预期审稿评分与关键论证\n  expected_results:\n    expected_reviewer_avg_score: 3.75\n    novelty_score: 4.0\n    soundness_score: 3.5\n    significance_score: 3.5\n    presentation_score: 4.0\n    reviewer_1_score: 4.0\n    reviewer_2_score: 3.5\n    reviewer_3_score: 3.75\n    meta_reviewer_recommendation: weak accept\n  result_rationale: Best tier 下，论文具备以下强项让 reviewers 给出 3.5-4.0 分：(1) Triple dissociation（importance/random/recency）提供了超越\n    correlation 的 mechanism discrimination evidence，novelty 得分 4.0；(2) 三 benchmark\n    × 三架构的泛化验证充分（但 7B-only 是明确 limitation）；(3) Recency control 作为 novel experimental\n    design contribution 无先例，方法论贡献被认可；(4) Cross-benchmark gradient 提供了 unified explanation\n    而非零散 findings。主要扣分点：(a) 7B models only（significance 扣 0.5）；(b) 无 throughput/latency\n    数据（practical impact 扣 0.25）；(c) entropy collapse 在 Qwen 上不一致（mechanism 完整性扣 0.25）。Architecture-dependent\n    specificity 被视为 interesting nuance 而非 confound——因为 within-importance gradient\n    在所有架构上 consistently large（d_z>0.8），差异仅在 imp/rand ratio 的 magnitude。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Anticipated Reviewer Score Breakdown'\n    content: 'Criterion      | R1   | R2   | R3   | Rationale\n\n      Novelty        | 4.0  | 4.0  | 4.0  | Triple dissociation + cross-benchmark\n      gradient novel\n\n      Soundness      | 3.5  | 3.5  | 3.5  | Strong stats, minor gap (QW entropy)\n\n      Significance   | 3.5  | 3.0  | 3.5  | 7B-only limits generalizability claim\n\n      Presentation   | 4.0  | 4.0  | 4.0  | Clear narrative, good figures\n\n      Overall        | 4.0  | 3.5  | 3.75 | —\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Best tier 预期 avg 3.75，meta-reviewer weak accept。关键 swing factor 是 R2 是否被\n    '7B-only' limitation 影响到 3.0 overall。Rebuttal 策略应预备：(1) 'scale limitation' 回应准备\n    LLaMA-8B 跨架构结果 + 计算资源声明；(2) 'practical impact' 回应准备 c5b pilot 结果 + future work\n    framing。\n","numLines":382,"startLine":1,"totalLines":382}}}
