{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YFmgJgF2H43oTUTdKnizfn","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-17\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| gpqa_ds_importance_s020 | Cross-task generalization: compound sparsity severity monotonically increases on GPQA Diamond (non-math reasoning) using quantile 3-segment phase decomposition. DS-R1 importance s020 as second condition (after s015 success). | ~140/198 | — | — |\\\\n| gpqa_ds_importance_s025 | Cross-task generalization: compound sparsity severity monotonically increases on GPQA Diamond (non-math reasoning) using quantile 3-segment phase decomposition. DS-R1 importance s025 as third condition (after s015 success, s020 running). | ~53/198 | — | — |\\\\n| gpqa_ds_importance_s030 | Cross-task generalization: compound sparsity severity monotonically increases on GPQA Diamond (non-math reasoning) using quantile 3-segment phase decomposition. DS-R1 importance s030 as fourth condition. | ~23/198 | — | — |\\\\n| gpqa_ds_random_s020 | Cross-task generalization: random eviction control on GPQA Diamond. DS-R1 random s020 to establish baseline phase gradient (expected NS or weak) for strategy specificity comparison. | ~23/198 | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **recency_s025** (success): Recency-based (position-only) eviction as scoring-independent control to disentangle phase segmentation circularity and H2O confound from attention-score-specific compound interaction. s=0.25 condition.\\\\n  [recency_s025_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/recency_s025/report/analysis.md)\\\\n- **recency_s030** (success): Recency-based (position-only) eviction as scoring-independent control to disentangle phase segmentation circularity and H2O confound from attention-score-specific compound interaction. s=0.30 condition.\\\\n  [recency_s030_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/recency_s030/report/analysis.md)\\\\n- **recency_s015** (success): Recency-based (position-only) eviction as scoring-independent control to disentangle phase segmentation circularity and H2O confound from attention-score-specific compound interaction. s=0.15 condition.\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 70 / 负向 17 / 失败 17 / 共 134\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-22162: 4× RTX 6000 Pro — GPU0 gpqa_ds_importance_s020 (PID 580927, ~70%), GPU1 s025 (PID 599103, ~27%), GPU2 s030 (PID 606507, ~12%), GPU3 random_s020 (PID 606658, ~12%)\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_interaction_index_profiling: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4c: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4d: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4-random: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4a_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4b_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4c_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4_legacy_s025: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4_legacy_s035: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4_float32_s030: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v5_fixed_s020: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v5_fixed_s030: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen_importance_s015: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen_importance_s020: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen_importance_s025: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen_importance_s030: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- v6_random_s030: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- v6_random_s030_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- bf16_random_s015: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- bf16_random_s020: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- bf16_random_s025: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- bf16_random_s030: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- bf16_qwen_importance_s015: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- bf16_qwen_importance_s020: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- bf16_qwen_importance_s025: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- b